# Admin Portal

All admin pages live at `/admin/*` and are protected by cookie-based session auth.

## Authentication flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Admin
    participant Page as Astro page
    participant Auth as checkAdminToken

    A->>Page: GET /admin/enquiries
    Page->>Auth: checkAdminToken(cookie, env)
    alt Invalid or missing
        Auth-->>Page: false
        Page-->>A: Redirect /admin/login
    else Valid
        Auth-->>Page: true
        Page->>D1: Fetch data
        Page-->>A: Rendered HTML
    end
```

> **Development shortcut:** the token `dev` is accepted when `APP_ENV === 'development'`. It is rejected in staging and production.

## Pages

| Page | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `/admin/enquiries` | Table with status tabs (All / Pending / Processed / Academy), search, pagination |
| `/admin/enquiries/[id]` | Full detail — contact info, event timeline, bookings list, resend/note actions |
| `/admin/bookings` | Session calendar — next 4 Tuesdays, per-slot athlete list, attendance buttons |
| `/admin/reports` | Metric cards + bar charts: monthly enquiries, booking funnel, academy pipeline, upcoming sessions |
| `/admin/templates` | Template list with active toggle |
| `/admin/templates/[id]` | Editor with live preview iframe, variable inserter, test send, unsaved-changes warning |
| `/admin/settings` | System config fields + age group editor (server-side POST — no separate API routes) |
| `/admin/academy` | Waitlist with season stats and manual invite-send button |
| `/admin/memberships` | Membership form submissions list |

## Data flow for admin pages

```mermaid
graph LR
    subgraph Pages["Admin pages (Astro SSR)"]
        direction TB
        List[List pages\nenquiries bookings reports]
        Detail[Detail pages\nenquiries/id templates/id]
        Action[Action pages\nsettings academy]
    end

    subgraph APIs["Admin API handlers"]
        direction TB
        Get[GET handlers\nfetch + paginate]
        Post[POST/PATCH handlers\nupdate + trigger actions]
    end

    subgraph D1
        DB[(Database)]
    end

    List & Detail -->|JS fetch| Get
    Action -->|form POST| Post
    Get & Post --> DB
```

## Attendance recording flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin
    participant Handler as /api/admin/bookings/:id/attendance
    participant D1
    participant Resend

    Admin->>Handler: POST { status: 'attended' }
    Handler->>D1: updateBookingStatus('attended')
    Handler->>D1: appendEnquiryEvent('attendance_recorded')
    Handler->>D1: Create membership_otp (secure token)
    Handler->>Resend: sendMembershipInvite()
    Handler->>D1: appendEnquiryEvent('membership_invite_sent')
    Handler-->>Admin: 200 { ok: true }
```

